'''Casaurian Ahirujo''' (超鳥獣アヒルジョー, ''Chō Chōjū Ahirujō'', '''Super Bird-Beast Ahirujō''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[Duche]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]].

